     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRSpecimenLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRSpecimenLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRSpecimenLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-specimen</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-prelevement</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement.id</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement.statusCode</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.specimenSource[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement.participant</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.parentSpecimen</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAPrelevement.participant:echantillonPreleve</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMSpecimen.request</td><td colspan=